# Xorg configuration: xorg.conf(5) manual page; requirements/languages/xorg.md
name     xorg xorgconf
keyword  Section EndSection SubSection EndSubSection Identifier Driver Option Device Screen Monitor
keyword  InputDevice InputClass ServerLayout Modes DefaultDepth MatchIsKeyboard MatchIsPointer
builtin  true false on off
fold-case
line-comment   #
string   " "  : escapes
